advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Halflings}

Summons Halflings to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Halflings summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Halflings.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Halflings}

Summons Halflings to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Halflings summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Halflings.
